Recommends: cron
Description: FreedomNAS WebUI — FastAPI appliance interface
 The web interface of the FreedomNAS appliance: storage, shares, users,
 network, updates and the first-run wizard, served by uvicorn over TLS.
 .
 Every dependency here is imported at start-up, python3-jinja2 included:
 api/main.py builds its Jinja2Templates at module level, and uvicorn
 reports a missing one only as "could not import module api.main".
